# data/ holds vapid.json — the VAPID PRIVATE KEY. The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`,
# so without this line the key is baked into the image layers. Keep it excluded;
# supply keys via VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY / VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY env vars in production.
